### ========================================================
### EMAIL FLOW
### ========================================================

### 1. EMAIL RECORD #1: Create (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "client1@example.com",
  "from": "notifications@example.com",
  "subject": "Email #1 Initial Notice",
  "body": "This is the original body for email record 1."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("email_id_1", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. EMAIL RECORD #1: Read (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/email/{{email_id_1}}

### 3. EMAIL RECORD #1: Update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/email/{{email_id_1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "This is the updated body for email record 1."
}

### --------------------------------------------------------

### 4. EMAIL RECORD #2: Create (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "client2@example.com",
  "from": "notifications@example.com",
  "subject": "Email #2 Deletion Target",
  "body": "This record will be deleted and archived."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("email_id_2", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. EMAIL RECORD #2: Read (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/email/{{email_id_2}}

### 6. EMAIL RECORD #2: Delete & Archive (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/email/{{email_id_2}}


### ========================================================
### TEXT (SMS) FLOW
### ========================================================

### 7. TEXT RECORD #1: Create (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+13175550101",
  "from": "+13175550100",
  "subject": "could this be the issue",
  "body": "Original SMS text for record 1."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("text_id_1", response.body.id);
%}

### 8. TEXT RECORD #1: Read (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/text/{{text_id_1}}

### 9. TEXT RECORD #1: Update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/text/{{text_id_1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Updated SMS text body for record 1."
}

### --------------------------------------------------------

### 10. TEXT RECORD #2: Create (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+13175550102",
  "from": "+13175550100",
  "body": "SMS text for record 2 to be deleted and archived."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("text_id_2", response.body.id);
%}

### 11. TEXT RECORD #2: Read (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/text/{{text_id_2}}

### 12. TEXT RECORD #2: Delete & Archive (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/text/{{text_id_2}}


### Test String Sanitization via POST
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "test.sanitizer@example.com",
  "from": "security@example.com",
  "subject": "Security Check <script>alert('bad');</script>",
  "body": "Check this link: javascript:void(0) and clean <script src='hack.js'></script> text."
}